Eddie''s journey in dog training has taken him all over the world, working with high-profile clients and their beloved pets. He has had the privilege of training notable figures such as Mike McCarthy, coach of the Dallas Cowboys; Rick Pitino, former player for the Boston Red Sox; and Ian Kessler, along with basketball stars like Gordon Hayward. These experiences have enriched his skills and broadened his perspective on dog training, enabling him to provide exceptional service to all clients.

Eddie is committed to fostering strong bonds between dogs and their owners. He believes in the power of positive reinforcement and aims to create a supportive and enjoyable learning environment for both dogs and their families. Eddie takes immense pride in the success stories of his clients, knowing that each transformed behavior enhances the quality of life for both the dog and the owner.

When he’s not training, Eddie enjoys spending time with his own dogs, exploring the outdoors, and continuing to learn more about canine behavior. His dedication to the art of dog training makes him a valued partner for all dog owners seeking to improve their relationship with their furry companions.',true,'{}'::text[]) on conflict (id) do nothing;
